WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.964
Looks like they're here.

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:10.593
You said you are going to hand over
the AHRV agent as well.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.638
We've brought the String Puppets
as promised.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:15.849
The returnees
are being transported here now as well.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:17.559
And the AHRV agent?

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:19.269
She should be arriving shortly!

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:22.397
You don't have everything as promised.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.481
Please wait!

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:24.691
They'll definitely bring her.

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:28.361
You'll send back the people
on the list as promised, right?

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:30.196
-I'm going back, right?
-Just as I thought.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.159
We will check the AHRV weapons first.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.249
This is so high!

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:43.334
I knew this would happen.

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:46.588
Lu and I will take care
of the enemies here.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.631
Marimari, go protect the buses!

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:49.549
Got it!

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.762
You have chosen to resist us!

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.346
No, we didn't!

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.766
What's going on? Hurry and make them stop!

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.436
Muta!

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:05.565
For the charge of assisting the enemy,
you're under arrest!

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.782
Stay away from me!

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.081
Something has appeared!

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:24.000
Keisaku! Where are you?

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.960
What's going on?

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.305
Thanks!

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:39.557
Marimari!

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.017
Good job!

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.102
Daisuke!

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:47.232
You can leave the rest to me!

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.443
Help!

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:52.946
No!

00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:08.378
-Why, you!
-Wait, Lu!

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.380
We can't let them split up our firepower.

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.173
Let's return to Marimari!

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.681
We need to make adjustments
to collect the materials.

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:22.100
They have no love for mankind.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:24.561
They're just a bunch of egoists.

